  "summary": "Optional. A deployer's view of the AI Act: prohibited practices, high-risk classification, logs kept six months, human oversight, robustness against manipulation, impact assessments and serious-incident reporting, with the Hawk AI controls that support each.",
  "scope": "Article numbers of the Regulation with our own short wording; the deployer's obligations first, the provider's for reference. Dates: prohibitions from 2 February 2025, general-purpose AI from 2 August 2025; the Digital Omnibus (November 2025) moves high-risk obligations to 2 December 2027 (Annex III) and 2 August 2028 (products), subject to its adoption.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 (EUR-Lex)",
